@startuml

title Card phase and optional pass

participant Client1
participant Server
participant Client2

loop while player actions remain
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(active player and selectable cards)
Client1->Server: ChooseCardRequest(cardIndex, row)

alt valid card choice
Server->Server: apply card and advance state
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client2: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(Card chosen, same snapshot)

opt after-everyone building grants an extra top-row choice
alt player takes the extra card
Client1->Server: ChooseCardRequest(cardIndex, topRow = true)
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client2: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(Card chosen, snapshot)
else player declines the extra card
Client1->Server: PassRequest
Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client2: GameViewUpdate(updated snapshot)
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(Turn passed, snapshot)
end
end

else invalid card, wrong turn, or wrong phase
Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult(failure, current snapshot)
end
end

note over Client1, Client2
Pass is only valid when the optional extra-card action is available.
end note

@enduml
